+### Fate compatibility patch: bounded aggregate run results
+
+When a host explicitly selects `session.agent.runHistoryMode = "last-turn"`, the core retains the final turn in `agent_end.messages`. Extensions receive `agent_end.runHistory` including the exact omitted message count. Original per-message events and SessionManager persistence are unchanged; consumers requiring the full transcript must read the session, not mistake the event tail for a complete run. The SDK default remains `"all"`.
